<title>USA: FHLMC sets callable pass-through series C23.</title>
<headline>FHLMC sets callable pass-through series C23.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Home Loan Mortgage Corp (Freddie Mac or FHLMC) said it issued $200 million of callable pass-through securities.</p>
<p>Callable pass-through series C23, underwritten by DLJ Securities Inc, has a coupon of 8.0 percent and is backed by Freddie Mac strip 178, FHLMC said.</p>
<p>The issue priced August 20 and has a settlement date of September 27, the agency said.</p>
<p>--N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1660</p>
</text>
